{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10370030","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10370030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1037003001:1":{"text":"숲 은신처 마을인 것 같아요. 저도 다른 사람한테 들은 거라 확실하지 않아요.","source_cn":"好像是林隐村，我不太确定，因为我也是听别人说的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BFC9F3767876C83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1037003002:1":{"text":"마을을 떠나서 안전한 곳으로 가려고 했는데,","source_cn":"我们本想搬离村子，去个安全的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x385D5E2B6E35CA61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1037003003:1":{"text":"최근 들어 갑자기 폭주하는 몬스터가 많아졌어요. 이런 상황에 안전한 곳이 어디 있겠어요!","source_cn":"可最近周围突然出现了很多发狂的怪物，这时候去哪找安全的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A724FC055E1760F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民芙妮妮":{"text":"프니니","source":"村民芙妮妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}